Licenses for this repository
============================

This repository contains original RAISE experiment code under `raise_env/` and
vendored third-party software.

- RAISE experiment tree (`raise_env/`, excluding `third_party/`): see
  `raise_env/LICENSE` and `raise_env/NOTICE.md`.
- Vendored CrowdNav++ simulator: `raise_env/third_party/crowdnavpp/LICENSE`
  (MIT, Copyright (c) 2023 Shuijing Liu). Upstream notes:
  `raise_env/third_party/crowdnavpp/UPSTREAM.md` and
  `raise_env/third_party/crowdnavpp/NOTICE.md`.

When redistributing, include the notices above with the corresponding trees.
